      "content": "cognitive biases? look i know how the textbook answers go but this wasnt just a memory slip. it felt programmed. like the assets were being reused to save on processing power. and it's not just visual, the math is starting to feel... hollow. like there's a simplified logic underneath everything. don't you think it's weird how everything follows such perfect, predictable patterns? like it's all following a set of pre-defined parameters rather than being truly random?",
